   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "s06 in one sentence: a Run is one piece of work with a target and an end ①, what it leaves makes it hard or soft ②, each round on it is a pass ③, and the workbench lists it while /haipipe-run keeps its card ④.",
   "originalText": "s06 in one sentence: a Run is one piece of work with a target and an end ①, what it leaves makes it hard or soft ②, each round on it is a pass ③, and the workbench lists it while /haipipe-run keeps its card ④.",
   "fontSize": 40,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
